{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "865ebe25-65d6-8a86-b1e3-3898a42bc183",
  "created_at": "2025-12-23T11:34:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rafael G. Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:32:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing Authority, this is Walter. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:32:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning, Walter. Sorry, I'm in a stairwell, so I'm going to sound like I'm inside a drum. I came in to drop off a package for my neighbor and then my phone rang, so here I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:32:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, I can hear you fine. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:32:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I want to change my party affiliation. I'm registered one way and I want to switch to another. How do I go about that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:32:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You'd fill out a voter registration form that updates your party. You can do it on paper, or through the state's online system if you have a Rhode Island license or state ID. Or I can mail you a form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:33:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail it, huh. [pause] Is there a deadline on it? Because I'm hearing the echo, sorry, is there a deadline?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:33:18-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is, but it depends on which election you're thinking of. Changes generally have to be in ahead of the cutoff for that election, and for a primary there can be an earlier date for switching parties. I'd want to confirm the exact date for the next one before I give you a day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:33:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so not today, then. Nothing's coming up that I need it for right this second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:33:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, no rush today. Let me take your mailing address and I'll send the form, and I'll note the next dates on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:33:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, hold on, somebody's coming down the stairs. [crosstalk] Okay. Actually, can you just send it to the address you have on file for me? Rafael Figueroa, F-I-G-U-E-R-O-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:33:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Rafael Figueroa. I'll send it to the address on your registration. It should come in a few days, with the holiday maybe a little longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:34:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Thank you, Walter. Have a good holiday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:34:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Take care."
    }
  ],
